      "values": {
        "en": "$\\Omega$ Has No Head Normal Form",
        "zh-CN": "$\\Omega$ 组合子没有首标准型"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "The term `Ω = (λx. x x) (λx. x x)` contracts to itself. Every head-reduction sequence therefore repeats `Ω`, so `Ω` has no head normal form.",
          "zh-CN": "项 `Ω = (λx. x x) (λx. x x)` 归约后仍为自身，因此任何首部归约序列都会重复 `Ω`，故 `Ω` 没有首标准型。"
        }
      }
    },
